    <string name="company_deta">Feasycom is a national high-tech enterprise focused on IoT wireless modules and solutions. With over a decade of experience in wireless communication, Feasycom helps customers achieve low-risk development, lower integration costs, and faster time-to-market. Its products are exported to Europe, North America, Japan, India, and beyond, serving thousands of clients with shipments exceeding 100 million units.
        \n\nInnovative IoT Solutions — Driven by technology and innovation, Feasycom offers a wide range of products, including BT modules, Wi-Fi &amp; BT combo modules, CAT-M modules, BLE beacons, gateways, BT/Wi-Fi adapters, antennas, and RFID series. Supporting services include FeasyCloud IoT platform, Android &amp; iOS apps, SDKs, and customized solutions.</string>

